# Jira REST API reference docs — rarely needed during code tasks
docs/development/jira/

# Confluence API reference docs — rarely needed during code tasks
docs/development/confluence/

# All runtime-generated output (reports, logs, tmp files)
# This directory is gitignored; contents change every run and are never source
generated/

# Large reference docs — read on demand via /requirements or /sync, not during searches
docs/product/requirements/
docs/product/metrics/
docs/development/architecture.md

# Auto-generated stats — never meaningful as source context
tests/coverage/

# Survey data files — not source code
data/

# .github/ — Copilot-owned customization surfaces (CLAUDE.md §Customization Ownership)
# CLAUDE.md rule: "Claude agents must avoid reading .github/ by default"
.github/agents/
.github/skills/
.github/prompts/
.github/hooks/
.github/summaries/
.github/mcp-guidelines.md
.github/mcp-web-research-setup.md

# .github/ — shared CI/infra; on-demand only (CLAUDE.md §Agent Communication Rules)
.github/workflows/
.github/dependabot.yml

# Python bytecode — never source context
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
